ion criterion is delivered by the multi-project outbound dispatch child (da7c).","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8571,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"low","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Add an acceptance criterion for the promote-only rule asserting a bound ticket's project cannot be changed.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","F1","T4"],"criteria":["E1"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.95,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Child bullet: 'Ticket project field — ... promote-only rule (cannot change project of a bound ticket). Delivers the empty-project criterion.'","AC3 covers only 'A ticket whose project is explicitly empty produces no outbound mutation' — nothing asserts the promote-only/immutability rule"],"finding":"The 'promote-only rule (cannot change project of a bound ticket)' described in the Ticket project field child has no covering acceptance criterion.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fc34cbdcae5906691","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Child decomposition: 'Ticket project field'; Acceptance Criteria list","norm_id":"nc8c8f1cc5783bf68","priority