ive external integration to be stated.","The underlying Jira transport (create_issue/search_issues in src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_backend.py) is already used in production, so the integration is FEASIBLE — this is a precondition-statement gap, not a capability gap. Evidence class: Partially-verified (integration exists and is production-used; the live-rehearsal precondition surface is unstated)."],"finding":"The 'Live multi-project rehearsal' child asserts a live integration against two live Jira Cloud projects plus the encrypted S3 remote but states no auth/credential/HTTPS preconditions for reaching either service (no JIRA_URL/JIRA_USER/JIRA_API_TOKEN, no S3 credential/bucket setup), and does not say how the two live projects are provisioned, selected, or write-scoped.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f71aea83fbb2170e1","impact":0.44,"is_primary":null,"location":"Child decomposition — 'Live multi-project rehearsal' bullet","norm_id":"n969a20fe3f5f4bbe","priority":0.11,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["The rehearsal child is picked up but the live Jira Cloud credentials / two target projects / S3 bucket credentials are not provisioned, so the test cannot run or silently skips, leaving the cross-project contamination failure mode unvalidated — the exact thing the child exists to cover.","The rehearsal creates issues in the wrong live project because the two projects' write-scoping was never pinned."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.25,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respec